    "802036 is the positive control. Harmful Deadly Poison 2818 has dispel type 4. Native done-damage queries",
    "must give the authored rank bonus against matching bleeding/poisoned targets, no bonus to clean targets,",
    "and no poison bonus to a spell outside the original mask."
  ],
